internal
=======================================================================

Private code of the root module (it cannot be imported from outside
github.com/sentinez/sentinez). The service wiring that uses it is in
pkg/apps/dmz/{edge,dataplane} and pkg/apps/gateway/apiserver; the docs
are in docs/03-edge.md, docs/05-dataplane-ebpf.md and docs/06-gateway.md.

apps/                the edge, the dataplane (demilitarized zone) and the
                     API server
  edge/engine        HTTP engine constructors, chosen by --engine
                     (Quic, Hertz, Standard)
  edge/http          builds the edge handler from the chain (http.Init)
  edge/http/option   options every chain plugin reads (level, exporter,
                     secret key)
  edge/transport     TLS (JA4 fingerprint) and OnConnect hooks
  edge/api.go        the gRPC service of the edge (RevProxyService)
  edge/events/{pub,sub}
                     empty for now
  dataplane          attaches the XDP program, then serves gRPC
  dataplane/driver   loads the eBPF objects and drives the maps
                     (context, security, monitor); the map API
  apiserver/controlplane/v1
                     registrars of the domain services (Analytic,
                     Communication, Greeter, IAM, Security, Tenant)
  apiserver/handlers serves the OpenAPI JSON and Swagger UI, and the
                     notification stream as server-sent events
  apiserver/middleware
                     Logging, CORS, SwaggerDefaultRoot, Injection
                     (SQLi/XSS), Scope

handlers/            the edge HTTP chain, one plugin per package
  handlers.go        New builds the chain; plugins() lists the plugins in
                     request order: trace, logging, domain, cdn, limiter,
                     waiting room, static, SecRule, SecRuleset, router
                     (linked by core/szhttp/chains.Build)
  trace logging routing cdn room static
  secure             domain, SecRateLimit, SecRule and SecRuleset plugins
  wrap/stage         wraps a plugin with the stage error and timing
  wrap/script        runs the Lua hooks of a domain around each stage

memory/              per-namespace runtime state of the edge (MemStore)
  memory.go          the store: routes, upstreams, rules, limiters, WAF,
                     CDN, certificates, scripts
  sync.go            settings shared by the edge nodes (Olric maps)
  central.go         the settings built from the tables of centraldata
  tls.go passthrough.go
                     TLS modes, upstream TLS and passthrough
  secrules secratelimits secrulesets cdnrules routes upstream
  certificates scripts settings
                     one package per kind of state

centralsync/         keeps the edge equal to the tables centraldata syncs:
                     loads them with the Sync stream, then follows the
                     changes published on the Olric channel

envhandlers/         Env: what the chain plugins provision themselves from
                     (memory, options, shared GeoIP databases)

defaults/            fallback listen addresses when the setting is unset
